  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Smith Chart control is a specialized data visualization tool used in RF (Radio Frequency) and microwave engineering to plot the complex impedance of transmission lines and matching networks. It renders both impedance (Z) and admittance (Y) Smith Charts and supports multiple series, data labels, tooltips, legends, grid lines, and responsive design. It is ideal for RF circuit design, antenna analysis, and telecommunications engineering applications built on ASP.NET Core.",
